---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="border-t border-line/70">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-4">
    <div class="md:col-span-2">
      <p class="font-semibold">WhisperFlow</p>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-sm leading-6 text-ink-dim">
        Open-source, local-first AI voice dictation. Your voice, your models, your machine.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-ink-dim">
        Apache-2.0 · Built with whisper.cpp, llama.cpp &amp; HuggingFace models.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Product</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-dim">
        <li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/features/">Features</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/download/">Download</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/pricing/">Pricing</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/sponsors/">Sponsors</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Project</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-dim">
        <li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/docs/">Documentation</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/docs/privacy/">Privacy</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="https://github.com/whisperflow/whisperflow">GitHub</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-line/70">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-2 px-4 py-5 text-xs text-ink-dim sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:px-6">
      <p>© {year} WhisperFlow contributors. Apache-2.0.</p>
      <p>Not affiliated with Wispr Inc. Independent, clean-room project.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
